msgctxt "@info:tooltip"
msgid ""
"Some applications can set their own geometry, overriding the window manager "
"preferences. Setting this property overrides their placement requests.<nl/"
"><nl/>This affects <interface>Size</interface> and <interface>Position</"
"interface> but not <interface>Maximized</interface> or "
"<interface>Fullscreen</interface> states.<nl/><nl/>Note that the position "
"can also be used to map to a different <interface>Screen</interface>"
msgstr ""
"Neki programi mogu sami da postave svoju geometriju, potiskujući postavke "
"menadžera prozora. Ovo svojstvo potiskuje njihove zahtjeve za postavljanje."
"<nl/><nl/>Utiče na <interface>Veličina</interface> i <interface>Položaj</"
"interface>, ali ne i na stanja <interface>maksimizovano</interface> i "
"<interface>Preko cijelog ekrana</interface>.<nl/><nl/>Imajte u vidu da "
"položaj može da posluži i za prebacivanje na drugi <interface>Ekran</"
"interface>"

